---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import ContactBanner from '../components/ContactBanner.astro';
import { services } from '../data/services';
---
<Layout title="Managed IT & Web Development in Fargo–Moorhead | Syntax" description="Managed IT, consulting, web development, SEO, and hosting for small and growing businesses. Based in Fargo–Moorhead. Built around you.">
  <section class="hero container">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="square"></span> TECHNOLOGY, WITH PURPOSE.</p>
      <h1>Managed IT.<br />Web development<span class="accent">.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">Less friction. More forward.<br class="desktop-break" /> Practical IT and web services for businesses in Fargo–Moorhead and remotely.</p>
      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button-dark" href="/services/">Explore our services <Icon name="arrow" size={19} /></a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Let’s talk <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-location"><span class="location-dot"></span> Fargo–Moorhead roots. Remote reach.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="connection-art" role="img" aria-label="Syntax connects your business with IT, strategy, websites, and growth.">
      <div class="art-caption"><span class="square"></span> All connected.</div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-outer"></div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-inner"></div>
      <div class="orbit-line orbit-line-horizontal"></div>
      <div class="orbit-line orbit-line-vertical"></div>
      <div class="art-center"><span>s<span class="accent">.</span></span></div>
      <div class="art-node node-it"><Icon name="it" size={22} /><span>IT support</span></div>
      <div class="art-node node-strategy"><Icon name="strategy" size={22} /><span>Strategy</span></div>
      <div class="art-node node-web"><Icon name="web" size={22} /><span>Websites</span></div>
      <div class="art-node node-growth"><Icon name="seo" size={22} /><span>Growth</span></div>
      <span class="orbit-point point-one"></span><span class="orbit-point point-two"></span>
      <div class="art-bottom">Built around your business.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="principles container" aria-label="The Syntax approach">
    <div><span class="mini-index">01 /</span><p>One partner.<br /><strong>The whole picture.</strong></p></div>
    <div><span class="mini-index">02 /</span><p>Plain language.<br /><strong>Practical solutions.</strong></p></div>
    <div><span class="mini-index">03 /</span><p>Built for today.<br /><strong>Ready for what’s next.</strong></p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="square"></span> WHAT WE DO</p><h2 id="services-heading">IT, websites, and growth.<br />One technology partner.</h2></div>
      <p>From the systems behind your team to the website in front of your customers. We connect the dots.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-grid">
      {services.map(service => (
        <a class="service-card" href={`/services/${service.id}/`}>
          <div class="card-top"><Icon name={service.icon} size={29} /><span class="mini-index">/{service.number}</span></div>
          <h3>{service.title}</h3>
          <p>{service.short}</p>
          <span class="card-bottom">Explore service <Icon name="arrow" size={19} /></span>
        </a>
      ))}
      <div class="service-card service-card-dark">
        <span class="eyebrow">IT’S ALL CONNECTED.</span>
        <h3>So are we.</h3>
        <p>One thoughtful partner.<br />A lot less back-and-forth.</p>
        <a class="card-bottom" href="/contact/">Find your starting point <Icon name="arrow" size={19} /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="approach-section">
    <div class="container section">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="square"></span> THE SYNTAX WAY</p><h2>A little clarity.<br />A lot of progress.</h2></div>
        <p>No unnecessary complexity. No one-size-fits-all playbook. Just a clear path from where you are to where you want to be.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="steps-grid">
        <article><span class="step-number">01</span><h3>First, we listen.</h3><p>Your goals, your people, your pain points. We get to know the business before we talk technology.</p></article>
        <article><span class="step-number">02</span><h3>Then, we simplify.</h3><p>We turn the moving parts into a practical plan. Clear priorities, thoughtful solutions, and pricing you can understand.</p></article>
        <article><span class="step-number">03</span><h3>Forward, together.</h3><p>We put the plan to work and help it evolve. You focus on your business. We help the technology keep up.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="retainer-preview container">
    <div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="square"></span> A PARTNER, NOT JUST A PROVIDER</p><h2>Built for<br />the long run.</h2><p>Ongoing support. Predictable monthly pricing.<br />A technology partner who knows your business.</p><a class="button button-light" href="/services/#pricing">Find your fit <Icon name="arrow" size={19} /></a></div>
    <div class="preview-price"><span class="eyebrow">MONTHLY PARTNERSHIPS FROM</span><p><span class="currency">$</span>600<span class="per-month">/mo</span></p><span>5 included hours. A stronger foundation.</span><div class="preview-price-note">3-month initial commitment.<br />Hosting & third-party costs billed separately.</div></div>
  </section>
  <ContactBanner />
</Layout>
